From 5112ea2cc473d56f9e31c839956f38e1f69800d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jorink
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:45:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] add liquid glass to blur nodes

wlr_scene_blur_set_glass() draws a blur node as liquid glass: its rounded
rim bends the blurred background outwards like a lens, with a little
chromatic dispersion and a specular highlight. The look is set scene-wide
with wlr_scene_set_glass_data(). The refraction is capped at the blur size,
as only the damage expanded by that much is re-blurred.
